# Every key below is OPTIONAL. With no keys at all, the tool runs fully in
# replay mode from the bundled raw cache (data/raw/): full pipeline, full UI.

# NewsData.io free-tier key (https://newsdata.io). Without it, live runs skip
# the third-party news source and log the skip; RSS sources still fetch.
#NEWSDATA_API_KEY=

# Groq API key (https://console.groq.com). Needed only for the live LLM stage
# (Phase 2). Without it, the LLM stage runs from cached outputs in replay mode.
#GROQ_API_KEY=

# Google AI Studio key. Second provider for the swap demo. Dev/testing only:
# the free tier permits training on prompts, so it never sees anything
# beyond the same public web content sent to Groq.
#GEMINI_API_KEY=
